OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'petrified' after home raided
OL,4,Afor crypto-cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FA man has told a court he is
OL,7,F"constantly so frightened" after three
OL,8,Fmen were jailed for breaking into his
OL,9,Fhome and trying to steal cryptocurrency
OL,10,Ffrom him.
OL,12,FTerroll Paul, 31, Mohamed Samagassi,
OL,13,F37, and Pierre Madzou, 30, broke into
OL,14,Fthe victim's Bristol home in the early
OL,15,Fhours of 15 May before assaulting him
OL,16,Fand demanding he hand over a large
OL,17,Famount of the digital currency.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBW-SW Eng NewsC Reg TVFWeather
FL,343,340,200,160,0,100
