OL,3,GNEWSAMan 'petrified' after home raided
OL,4,Afor crypto-cash
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe victim was hit over the head and
OL,7,Freceived a substantial injury requiring
OL,8,Fhospital treatment; all three men were
OL,9,Farrested at the scene after the
OL,10,Fvictim's teenage sister alerted police.
OL,12,FThe men had all previously admitted to
OL,13,Faggravated burglary and, on Thursday,
OL,14,Fwere given prison sentences totalling
OL,15,F16 and a half years.
